MCP setup for Generic MCP JSON
Add to: your MCP client's mcpServers configuration

{
  "mcpServers": {
    "eshu": {
      "args": [
        "mcp",
        "start"
      ],
      "command": "eshu"
    }
  }
}

Notes:
  - Most MCP clients accept this "mcpServers" object; place it where your client expects.
